# weather.com: the hourly carousel scrolls its own box inside one that hides its overflow; ArrowLeft has to step to the next hour, which is out of view beside the carousel, over the next column.
https://weather.com/
wait:3000
start:css=a.absolute.rounded-xl[aria-label^='21:00']
key:ArrowLeft
expect:css=a.absolute.rounded-xl[aria-label^='20:00']
